    "dse.followups": {
      "label": "My engine: plan follow-ups",
      "group": "My engines",
      "help": "Finds everyone you messaged (and marked Sent) who has not answered, works out who is due for a second or third message, drafts it and saves it as a list in the Send Desk. Rules: touch 2 and 3 come due 3 and 7 days after an email or Instagram message (Facebook 4 and 9, website form 5 and 12), Sundays are skipped, there is never a second Instagram DM (a comment, then a note by email or form), and it stops when they reply, book, are lost or you skip. Only rows you marked Sent count; it lists any you never marked. You still send every message yourself.",
